## Verdicts

```mdl
verdict F-1.1: A Feed is an append log of ECHO objects.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#Feed, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#append]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-client-e2e/src/feed.test.ts]
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.2: Soft fork gives per-item lineage in one feed; there are no branch ids or fork points.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#PARENT_KEY, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#history]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.test.ts]
  note: |
    Lineage needs no extra ECHO objects, as required, and `Feed.history` resolves one head back
    through its ancestors. A branch has no id, no parent branch and no stored fork point, and the
    `Feed` object holds no map of branches.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.3: Obj.update re-appends the whole object by id; the index keeps the latest block.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#update]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-client-e2e/src/feed.test.ts]
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.4: No branch can be removed; Feed.remove tombstones single items.
  status: missing
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#remove]
  note: Searched `Feed.ts`, the feed store and the indexer for a removed or hidden branch state; none exists.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.5: Rewind is a separate mechanism, not a branch plus removal.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#Feed, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#history]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.test.ts]
  note: |
    `Feed.rewindFrom` on the Feed object carries a pending rewind, and the abandoned items are
    dropped at read time by `Feed.history` following `PARENT_KEY`. Nothing creates a branch or marks
    the old one removed.
```

```mdl
verdict F-2.1: Indexing is on or off per feed; queries cannot be scoped to branches.
  status: missing
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#IndexingOptions, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Scope.ts#feed]
  note: |
    `Feed.IndexingOptions` has no subset mode and `Scope.feed` takes only a feed URI. The index has
    no branch column, so a branch filter cannot run before `limit`.
```

```mdl
verdict F-2.2: The feed store has heads per namespace, not per branch.
  status: missing
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/feed/src/feed-store.ts#FeedStore]
  note: |
    The feed store answers a caught-up cursor without reading blocks and moves a head per namespace
    (feed-store tests "answers a caught-up cursor…", "moves the head of the namespace…"). No call
    lists the branches whose heads changed since a cursor.
```

```mdl
verdict F-2.3: Sync is per feed; no client can sync one branch.
  status: missing
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#sync]
  note: '`Feed.sync` pulls the whole feed. Blocks carry no branch id that EDGE could select on.'
```

```mdl
verdict F-2.4: EDGE position exists; local order is only the unexposed insertionId.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/protocols/src/FeedProtocol.ts#Block]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/feed/src/feed-store.test.ts]
  note: |
    `position` is assigned by the position authority and converges. Local order is `insertionId`,
    marked for removal; `Filter.feedCursor({ order: 'local' })` and `Feed.getLocalCursor` from #13782
    are not on main.
```

```mdl
verdict F-3.1: AI chat, comments and messaging do not share one model.
  status: missing
  note: `Chat`, `Thread` and `Channel` are separate ECHO types, each with its own feed and shape.
```

```mdl
verdict F-4.1: No read is scoped to a branch, so privacy by construction is not possible yet.
  status: missing
  note: There are no branches to scope a default read to; a feed read returns every item.
```

```mdl
verdict F-4.2: Writers are attributed per block; a fixed turn view and late-item detection are not found.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/protocols/src/FeedProtocol.ts#Block, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#history]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/feed/src/feed-store.test.ts]
  note: |
    Each block names its `actorId` and `sequence`, and soft-fork lineage is per item, so a fork does
    not misattribute an unaware writer. Concurrent `Obj.update` is last-flush-wins. Nothing fixes a
    turn's view at its start or flags a late item (`PromptState.stale` is in #13782).
```

```mdl
verdict F-4.3: No branch exists to create.
  status: missing
  note: Soft fork costs one `PARENT_KEY` on an existing item, but there is no branch record to count.
```

```mdl
verdict F-4.4: Retention is per feed only.
  status: missing
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Feed.ts#RetentionOptions]
  note: '`Feed.RetentionOptions` (`maxLength`, `maxAge`) applies to a whole feed; there is no per-branch policy.'
```

```mdl
verdict F-4.5: Permissions are per feed; no narrower branch audience.
  status: missing
  note: Searched the Feed module and feed store for a per-branch audience; none exists.
```

```mdl
verdict Block: FeedProtocol.Block has every field the spec names.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/protocols/src/FeedProtocol.ts#Block]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/feed/src/feed-store.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/protocols/src/FeedProtocol.test.ts]
  note: |
    `actorId`, `sequence`, `prevActorId`, `prevSequence`, `timestamp`, `data` (ciphertext when
    sealed), `position` (per space and namespace, tested) and `insertionId` are all present. The local
    order API over `insertionId` that #13782 adds is not on main.
```

